      <h1 class="tpf-title">“I think I just reverse engineered alcohol.”</h1>
      <p class="tpf-dek">Why I spent five years building a zero-proof cocktail you can actually feel, and why I'd rather you try it than take my word for it.</p>
      <p class="tpa-byline"><strong>Josh Hahn</strong>, co-founder of TIPSY AF</p>
    </header>

    <div class="tpf-body">
      <p class="tpf-salute">Hey,</p>

      <p>In 2013 I helped launch what would become the world's largest mushroom research and ingredient company. It went on to raise over $220 million to bring functional mushrooms to the mainstream.</p>

      <p>Like anyone building a career, I said yes to everything. Every trip. Every client dinner. Being on the road took its toll, and I kept telling myself I'd get healthy once things slowed down. They never did.</p>

      <p class="tpf-pull">I was sick of the hangovers. But I didn't want to give up the part I actually liked.</p>

      <p>The part I liked was the first drink: shoulders drop, the conversation gets easier, the night opens up. What I didn't like was everything after. The second-guessing, the bad sleep, the next morning.</p>

      <p>I'd tried the alternatives. Mocktails taste like a cocktail and feel like a soda. The drinks that do give you a feeling usually get it from kava, kratom or THC, and that's not something I wanted to hand my friends.</p>

      <h2>So I put my mushroom background to the test</h2>

      <p>After one too many hangovers, I set out to see if I could create a better buzz. I spent the next five years on what felt like an impossible mission: hundreds of test formulas, brain wave studies, versions we gave to heavy drinkers and lightweights, and plenty of runs we killed because they didn't work.</p>

      <figure class="tpf-figure">
        <img src="https://gettipsy.com/cdn/shop/files/Pouring_Pineapple_martini.png?width=1284" srcset="https://gettipsy.com/cdn/shop/files/Pouring_Pineapple_martini.png?width=700 700w, https://gettipsy.com/cdn/shop/files/Pouring_Pineapple_martini.png?width=1284 1284w" sizes="(min-width: 760px) 620px, 100vw" width="1284" height="1284" loading="lazy" alt="Pouring a can of TIPSY AF Pineapple Martini into a glass">
      </figure>

      <p>Then one day I randomly called my dad and told him, <em>“I think I just reverse engineered alcohol.”</em></p>

      <p>After some laughs and some confusion, he tried it. Then he came out of retirement as CEO of that same mushroom company and co-founded TIPSY AF with me.</p>

      <h2>What's actually in the can</h2>

      <p>TIPSY AF is a zero-proof cocktail made with five functional mushrooms (chaga, maitake, shiitake, reishi and turkey tail) plus L-theanine, GABA and theobromine. The formula is patent pending, and every ingredient is FDA-reviewed and legal to ship to all 50 states.</p>

      <ul class="tpf-facts">
        <li><strong>10–15 min</strong><span>to feel it</span></li>
        <li><strong>About an hour</strong><span>per can</span></li>
        <li><strong>Zero</strong><span>alcohol, kava, kratom, THC</span></li>
      </ul>

      <p>It's not meant to knock you over. It's that first-drink feeling, and when it's done, it's done. Have another if you want to keep it going.</p>

      <h2>Don't take my word for it</h2>

      <p>I'm obviously biased, so here's what a few customers told us:</p>

      <blockquote class="tpa-quote">“The buzz is a real thing. 10 minutes later I felt it and I was so relaxed.”<cite>Dominic H.</cite></blockquote>
      <blockquote class="tpa-quote">“I was skeptical, but I loved it! Nice little buzz, but doesn't make me crave alcohol.”<cite>Carolyn L.</cite></blockquote>

      <p>Everyone feels it a little differently, so the best test is your own. That's why we start people with six cans and a 100-day money-back guarantee. If it doesn't make your night better, email us and we'll refund you, even if you opened the cans.</p>

      <p>Cheers,</p>
      <p class="tpf-sign">Josh</p>
      <p class="tpf-sign-sub">Josh Hahn, co-founder, with my dad</p>
      <figure class="tpf-figure tpf-figure--founders">
        <img src="https://gettipsy.com/cdn/shop/files/founders.png" width="336" height="190" loading="lazy" alt="Josh Hahn and his father, the TIPSY AF co-founders">
      </figure>
    </div>

